  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Sturdy is a lending protocol that aggregates yield from multiple DeFi strategies, allowing users to deposit assets and earn optimized returns. It uses tokenized vaults (TokenizedStrategy) to manage deposits and route funds to various yield sources like Silo and Aera.",
